# 02-AVT / avatars and jobs to be done

**Goes here.** How to find out who buys, in what situation, to make what progress, and
what proof they need first. Research method, interview technique, review mining,
awareness levels, objection discovery, segmentation, off label use, and customer
market research.

## Not here

- How to answer an objection on a page -> 07-LPG
- Which offer mechanic kills an objection -> 03-OFF
- How the brand should speak -> 04-BRD
- Which market to enter -> 01-PRD
- Managing your own reviews on Amazon -> 22-AMZ

AVT is discovery. Everything downstream is application. If the source tells you what
to build rather than how to find out, it belongs downstream.

**The AVT and PRD line.** "Market research" that means researching customers is AVT.
"Market research" that means choosing which market to enter is PRD.

